{"seq":173,"elapsed_ms":3568,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need implement decade counter 1..10 inclusive on 4-bit q. Reset active high synchronous, resets to 1. On clock edge: if reset q<=1; else if q==10 q<=1; else q<=q+1.\n\nNeed output q 4 bits. Implement.\n\nProvide single module between BEGIN and DONE."}}}
{"seq":174,"elapsed_ms":3571,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  logic       clk,\n    input  logic       reset,\n    output logic [3:0] q\n);\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset)\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        else if (q == 4'd10)\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        else\n            q <= q + 4'd1;\n    end\n\nendmodule\n[DONE]"}}}
